<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Membership - High Street Gym</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/common.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/membership.css">

</head>

<body>
    <header>
        <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    </header>

    <main class="membership-page">
        <section class="hero-section">
            <h1>Membership Options</h1>
            <p class="tagline">No Pressure. No Obligations. Just Great Training.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="intro-section">
            <div class="intro-box">
                <h2>A Refreshing Change</h2>
                <p>With hard-selling 'health club' sales consultants hustling you on every corner, we pride ourselves on
                    being a refreshing change from that. Our 'no obligation, no pressure' attitude is clearly evident
                    with our <strong>$10 CASUAL visit rate</strong>.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="membership-options">
            <div class="membership-card casual">
                <div class="card-header">
                    <h3>Casual Visit</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="price">
                        <span class="amount">$10</span>
                        <span class="period">per visit</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="features">
                        <li>✓ No commitment</li>
                        <li>✓ Try before you join</li>
                        <li>✓ Access to all equipment</li>
                        <li>✓ All locations</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="/register" class="btn-join">Visit Now</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="membership-card featured">
                <div class="ribbon">Most Popular</div>
                <div class="card-header">
                    <h3>Full Membership</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="price">
                        <span class="amount">Contact Us</span>
                        <span class="period">for pricing</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="features">
                        <li>✓ 24/7 access</li>
                        <li>✓ All group classes included</li>
                        <li>✓ All locations</li>
                        <li>✓ Les Mills certified trainers</li>
                        <li>✓ Boxing & Karate classes</li>
                        <li>✓ Circuit training</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="/register" class="btn-join">Join Now</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="features-section">
            <h2>Why Choose High Street Gym?</h2>

            <div class="features-grid">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🕐</div>
                    <h3>True 24/7 Access</h3>
                    <p>We are open 24:7. YOU can now train any time you like, weekdays, weekends & public holidays. WE
                        ARE OPEN!</p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">👥</div>
                    <h3>Always Staffed</h3>
                    <p>Unlike other so called 24:7 gyms, we are staffed all the time. If you need a late-night workout,
                        a protein bar or shake, supplements or a cool t-shirt, we are open for you.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">📅</div>
                    <h3>Flexible Classes</h3>
                    <p>Our class times change constantly so check out on the website for the timetable at each of our
                        clubs.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🚫</div>
                    <h3>No Hard Sell</h3>
                    <p>No annoying telemarketers or pushy membership consultants. Just great gyms and passionate
                        trainers.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="cta-section">
            <h2>Ready to Get Started?</h2>
            <p>Try us out with a casual visit or jump straight in with full membership</p>
            <div class="cta-buttons">
                <a href="/register" class="btn-primary">Sign Up Now</a>
                <a href="/timetable" class="btn-secondary">View Class Schedule</a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    </footer>
</body>

</html>